WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Every week dozens of apps appear that promise to «do all your work». Keeping up does not mean installing them all, but asking four questions: 1) What specific problem does it solve? 2) Does it train on my data, or can I switch that off?

2
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:32.000
3) Does it get 5 real cases right whose answer I already know? 4) How do I export my work if tomorrow it changes its price or shuts down? Goal: evaluate an AI tool with a controlled test before relying on it.

3
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:48.000
A viral video advertises an app that «answers all your customers while you sleep». Your task: design a careful check before connecting it to a real business's email. Hint: a thirty-second advert shows the best case, never the failures.

4
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:55.200
Now do the lesson exercises. If you are unsure, watch this video again.
